                "message": "🐛 Vendor consult-omni and fix the empty-source \"Args out of range\" error\n\nThe sources were never loaded (the loader call sat in a :tangle no block), so\nevery search ran with an empty source vector. Load them in :config, guard the\nvendored code against an empty list, fix the scope commands' argument order,\nadd a Vulpea source and sp-fetch-academic-omni, and record the Google Scholar\ncomparison.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAn4WtUefbCv1hoZoL",
                "tree": {
